{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我出门了。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "出门前，我跟樱乃打声招呼。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天也去爱理家？”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sk0623", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……嗯。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是那样没错……但是被樱乃淡淡的语气一说，“今天也”这三个字让我莫名害羞。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……樱乃也来吗？”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不想当电灯泡。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sk0624", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我又不是去跟她亲亲热热的……”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然能享受两人独处的时光的确让我很开心啦。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过目前要把该做的事情要确实做好。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理今天也会拼命念书吧。我也一起加油……", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，新吾……咳、咳。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3038", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么、怎、怎么回事！？你还好吧！？”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我连忙赶到她身边。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理看起来很不舒服的样子。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感冒……？”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像是……有点，咳咳！一个不注意昨天在暖桌睡着了，大概……”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3039", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……为什么？”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一直在为考试念书，不知不觉就……”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3040", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我可以想像得到那个景象。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她白天也是努力念书到过头的程度……", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咳、咳！”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3041", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之……今天休息比较好。”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我拍了拍爱理的背，温柔地催促她。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──爱理的身体，隔着衣服也能感觉到好热。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不可能那么做吧……明天、唔唔、考试就要开始了！”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3042", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理不接受我的建议。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔……没错，我才解题解到一半，新吾也、咳咳、来坐下吧……”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3043", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来在我来之前，她也一直在念书。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "整个人都摇摇晃晃了……", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啾！唔……”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3044", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理，来，爱理。”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3045", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你已经强迫自己１个小时了吧……？你必须停下来休息一下才行。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很烦欸！不要打扰我念书！”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3046", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啾！”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3047", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──那之后，不管我怎么说爱理还是不肯休息。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "埋头拼命念书。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊唔……唔唔……唔唔……”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3048", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊真是的……好好工作啊，我的脑袋……”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3049", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身体状况似乎越来越恶化。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的脸色发白，整个人都摇摇晃晃的。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理……”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要……”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3050", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么要这样？”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我要考到年级第一名才行啊！”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3051", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住大声问她，爱理却用更大的音量回答我。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我咬紧牙关注视着爱理。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾也听过我跟妈妈说的话吧……”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3052", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理仿佛很艰难才说出这句话。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我跟妈妈约好要保持成绩，才让我、咳咳……让我一个人生活的。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3053", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明明是这样、唔唔，只是感冒而已……不能因此影响到考试念书……！”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3054", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──这似乎是爱理的骄傲，也是她的自尊。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我非常明白。她的心情都传达给我了。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔、唔唔……咳咳、唔……唔～”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3055", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，爱理在我面前痛苦地呻吟。明明痛苦却仍动着笔。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果在以前……", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我绝对不会做干扰她这份意志的行为吧，不过──", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……够了，给我去休息！！！”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我大吼。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──现在不同了。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是看她脸色的时候了，我很担心爱理，我必须这么做才行……", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "应该说，只有我才能这么做。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、啊、欸、欸……新、吾……？”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3057", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你该休息了。”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3058", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什……什么嘛，讨厌，那种事、我、我知道啦……”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3059", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一下下而已喔，３小时而已。然后我就要起来……只休息３小时而已……”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3060", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理虽然不情愿，但还是躺到了床上。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻点头。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理的身体状况太糟糕，她一躺下立刻就睡着了。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘶……嘶……嗯嗯……”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3061", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "３个小时过后她也没有醒。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3062", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一直待在她身边，帮她换额头上的湿毛巾以及擦汗。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，我不打算叫醒她，我希望她继续休息。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……唔、唔……”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3063", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“连睡着也这么不舒服，还那样逞强……”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "胸口好难受。呼吸不过来的感觉。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前，经常在爱理身上感觉到的“紧绷感”，我……又感觉到了。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尖锐犀利，又逞强……仿佛下一秒就要断裂的紧绷感。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈……哈啊、哈啊、唔咕……新、吾……”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3064", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻柔地摸摸爱理的头发。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个叫做濑名爱理的女孩子，总是散发出紧绷的气息。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“妈……妈……唔唔……唔啊、啊……”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "ar3065", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──跟学园长之间，一直存在的紧绷感。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一想到这点我实在坐立难安。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "拿出手机──", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘你好，我是安洁～’", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ag0569", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁，不好意思突然打给你……安洁知道学园长的电话吗？”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘喔、喔……知道啊……’", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ag0570", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以告诉我吗？我想找她。……爱理生病了。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我来到室外打电话。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──我觉得要把现状告诉那个人比较好。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁说学园长现在在学校里。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我重新拨打结女的电话……", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……喂，电话换人接了。’", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "rk0229", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，学园长您好，我是瓜生。不好意思突然打电话给您。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘怎么了？’", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "rk0230", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "电话那头的学园长直接问重点。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我哽了一下，然后慎重地说。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个……其实我有件事想告诉您。”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘小新吾有事对我说？是什么呢？’", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "rk0231", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……爱理同学生病了。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘…………’", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "rk0232", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该是感冒，虽然不需要太担心……”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过她逞强念书，所以变成这样。”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──我会联络学园长当然是因为她是爱理的监护人。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过除此之外，我也想知道她听了会有什么反应。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理同学，一副赌气的感觉。非常在意学园长的想法的样子。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──我无法放着这件事不管。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为什么这两个人会……", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学园长，那个……”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……是爱理叫你联络我的吗？’", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "rk0233", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "打断我的话，学园长冷静地问。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不是，是我擅自决定的。”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只能这样回答。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘喔……’", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "rk0234", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘那么，我不会再听你说。’", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "rk0235", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长平稳的语气中混着一丝叹息。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她结束这个话题。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘不过，小新吾在照顾着爱理是吧？’", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "rk0236", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……谢谢。爱理就麻烦你了。’", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 321, "voice": "rk0237", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……说完后，她就挂断了电话。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sk0625", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我回到室内。在我暂时出去的这段时间，是樱乃代替我照顾爱理。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是在打给安洁之前，我请她来帮忙的。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学园长说什么……？”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sk0626", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理麻烦你了，就这样。”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这样啊。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sk0627", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理呢？”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有变化。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sk0628", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊……我打算今天住下来，樱乃呢？”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一起。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sk0629", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也在爱理身旁坐下。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然内心还是躁动不安……", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──总之，现在就专心照顾爱理吧。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
